  "description": "CaveSystems Extensions Library.\n\t\t\tProvides reusable extension methods for various .NET classes.\n\t\t\tIncludes fast implementations for CRC32 and CRC64.\n\t\t\tOffers Base32 and Base64 encoding utilities.\n\t\t\tContains helpers and backports for older framework versions.\n\t\t\tSupports classic .NET Framework, .NET Standard, and modern .NET.\n\t\t\tUtility package for cross-target application development.",
